{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/973971-comedy-a-mummy-a-vamp-and-a-mage","id":973971,"title":"[Comedy] A Mummy, a Vamp and a Mage","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-21T12:31:06-07:00","id":973971,"title":"[Comedy] A Mummy, a Vamp and a Mage","content":"Imagine a comedy show based around these three living through the ages (Not unlike Being Human smashed with What we do in the Shadows).<br /> <br /> The mummy can feel her bones and muscles gaining life back, able to move... a single thought in her mind: Wake up... wake up and serve your duties....<br /> As she opens her eyes and raise from her eternal slumber, a strange man is sitting nearby, looking at his watch.<br /> <br /> &quot;<b>Finally!</b> Do you know how long you've been sleeping!?&quot;<br /> <br /> The mummy is confused, unable to remember this man's name... a member of her cult, perhaps? Before she can ask, a flash of light blinds her and a girl appears in the room, holding an enormous cake decorated with hundreds of candles.<br /> <br /> &quot;Sorry I'm late! Did I miss it? Awwwwww Damn it!&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>---------------------------IMMORTALS---------------------------</b><br /> <br /> Mum: Soooo what happened while I was sleeping?<br /> Mag: We finally understood that the blacks were just humans with a different skin tone and we created a huge network of electromagnetic waves with which we share pornography and buy cat toys<br /> Vlad: It's the darkest time of Human history<br /> Mag: What do you mean? It's fucking awesome! Now I don't have to bother summoning abyssals to watch tentacle... Erm... I mean... Amazon. Yes. Amazon is good.<br /> Mum: Huh. That's pretty bad I guess.<br /> Mum(After a while): Hey! Wait! I'M BLACK!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>---------------------------IMMORTALS---------------------------</b><br /> <br /> Vlad: 